= Random Drop Items =

These can drop randomly from any mobs, are not used in quests, and almost all bosses always have at least one.

== Haste Belts ==

Every melee classs has a 21% haste belt, while every hybrid class instead has a 16% haste belt.

<ul><li>  {{:Belt of Concordance}} (Bard)
</li><li> {{:Belt of Contention}} (Warrior)
</li><li> {{:Belt of Iniquity}} (Shadow Knight)
</li><li> {{:Belt of the Pine}} (Ranger)
</li><li> {{:Belt of Tranquility}} (Monk)
</li><li> {{:Belt of Transience}} (Rogue)
</li><li> {{:Belt of Virtue}} (Paladin)
</li></ul>

== Bracers ==

Every intelligence caster gets a bracer (with no haste).

<ul><li> {{:Bracelet of Cessation}} (Necromancer)
</li><li> {{:Bracelet of Distortion}} (Wizard)
</li><li> {{:Bracelet of Exertion}} (Magician)
</li><li> {{:Bracelet of Quiescence}} (Enchanter)
</li></ul>

